All seven build items are done in `/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-heap-gc` (branch `vm-heap-reclamation`, nothing staged or committed). The full JVM suite and `bb test:cljs` pass with 0 failures. Each tested part was proven by temporary mutation: 18 mutations, all caught, and all restored.

